flowchart LR
    S[Authorized prepared source] --> A[Author declaration and implementation]
    A --> C[Capture immutable build context]
    C --> B[Host broker runs Buildx and BuildKit]
    B --> L[Explicit load into local Engine]
    L --> I[Record local image ID and platform]
    I --> T[Independent sandbox qualification]
    T --> E[Local admission for future plans]
    I --> X[Candidate image and source export]
    T --> X
    X --> Q[Central rebuild and qualification]
    Q --> R[Tested release and registry pins]
